# Astrotask

A personal productivity tracking application with time tracking, kanban boards, and task management. Built with a Go backend and Next.js frontend.

## Quick Start (Local Development)

### Prerequisites

- Docker & Docker Compose
- Go 1.23+ (for running backend directly)
- Node.js 18+ (for running frontend directly)

### Option 1: Docker (Recommended)

The fastest way to get everything running:

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/astrotask.git
cd astrotask

# Copy environment file
cp .env.local .env

# Start all services (postgres, backend, frontend)
docker-compose up --build

# Or run in background
docker-compose up --build -d
```

The app will be available at:
- **Frontend**: http://localhost:3000
- **Backend API**: http://localhost:8080/api/v1
- **PostgreSQL**: localhost:5432

### Option 2: Hybrid (Postgres in Docker, services locally)

Better for development - no rebuild needed when you change code:

```bash
# Start only postgres
docker-compose up postgres -d

# Terminal 1: Run backend
cd backend
go run cmd/server/main.go

# Terminal 2: Run frontend
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

