## Authentication System

Astrotask uses an **invite-only** signup system:

1. The first user to sign up with the `ADMIN_EMAIL` becomes an admin
2. Admins can create invite links for new users
3. New users need an invite link to sign up

### Getting Your First Invite

When the backend starts, it creates an admin invite and prints it to the console:

```
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  ADMIN INVITE CREATED
  Email: jyn@astrotask.io
  URL: http://localhost:3000/signup?invite=abc123...
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

Use this URL to create your admin account.

