## Tech Stack

- **Backend**: Go 1.23, Gin framework, GORM ORM
- **Frontend**: Next.js 14, React 18, TypeScript
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 16
- **Auth**: JWT tokens with HTTP-only cookies
- **Email**: Resend API
- **Encryption**: Client-side AES-256-GCM for user data

## API Endpoints

### Authentication
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/signup` | Register with invite token |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Login |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/logout` | Logout |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/refresh` | Refresh JWT token |
| GET | `/api/v1/auth/profile` | Get current user profile |
| PATCH | `/api/v1/auth/profile` | Update profile |
| GET | `/api/v1/auth/invitation/:token` | Validate invite token |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/request-invite` | Request an invite |

### Tasks
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/v1/tasks` | List all tasks |
| POST | `/api/v1/tasks` | Create task |
| PATCH | `/api/v1/tasks/:id` | Update task |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/tasks/:id` | Delete task |
| GET | `/api/v1/active` | Get currently active task |

### Sessions (Time Tracking)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/v1/tasks/:id/sessions/start` | Start timer |
| POST | `/api/v1/tasks/:id/sessions/stop` | Stop timer |
| GET | `/api/v1/tasks/:id/sessions` | Get task sessions |
| GET | `/api/v1/tasks/:id/sessions/active` | Get active session |

### Columns (Kanban)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/v1/columns` | List columns |
| POST | `/api/v1/columns` | Create column |
| PATCH | `/api/v1/columns/:id` | Update column |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/columns/:id` | Delete column |

### Admin
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/v1/admin/invitations` | Create invite |
| GET | `/api/v1/admin/invitations` | List invites |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/admin/invitations/:id` | Revoke invite |

## Common Issues

### Database connection refused
```bash
# Make sure postgres is running
docker-compose up postgres -d

# If password mismatch, reset the volume
docker-compose down -v
docker-compose up postgres -d
```

### Port already in use
```bash
# Find what's using the port
lsof -i :8080  # or :3000, :5432

# Kill it
kill -9 <PID>
```

### Frontend can't reach backend
- Check that backend is running on port 8080
- Verify CORS is configured for `http://localhost:3000`
- Check browser console for specific errors

